<title>UK: CSFB sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it has issued four million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p>COMON TERMS:.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JAN.97-13.MAR.98   PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  18093.13 YEN</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE     ISSUE(INDIC) PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	   18000 YEN  2.20 CHF     9.96 PCT   9.67 X</p>
<p> CALL	   19000 YEN  1.80 CHF     13.61 PCT  11.82 X</p>
<p> PUT	    19000 YEN  2.80 CHF     18.30 PCT  7.60 X</p>
<p> PUT	    18000 YEN  2.10 CHF     9.49 PCT   10.1 X</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  CSWM /N</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
